- **Modalities:** text + image in, text out (models.dev `attachment = true`); reasoning yes (effort none/low/medium/xhigh); `tool_call = false` per models.dev; open weights false.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-29):** Vercel page shows no public price ("see the provider details"); models.dev listing records $0 input / $0 output; repo meta.json says "Standard pricing" — no verified paid price found. Vercel notes prompts and outputs may be retained for training.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed — no parameters, license, or weights disclosed (stealth model; `open_weights = false`).

